*.js
!jest.config.js
# ...and test/ helpers are hand-written source, not tsc output. `tsc` never
# emits into test/ (there is no outDir and the sources there are .ts), so
# anything .js here was written by hand. markdown-transform.js gives jest the
# `*.md` text loader esbuild has, and without it every retrieval test fails to
# import the corpus. This negation exists because `md.d.ts` was silently
# untracked by the rule below for weeks, and the same trap was two minutes from
# repeating.
!test/**/*.js
*.d.ts
# ...but lambda/ declarations are hand-written source, not build output.
# md.d.ts declares `*.md` for the esbuild text loader, and without it the Lambda
# typecheck fails on every markdown import. It was silently untracked until CI
# ran and could not find it.
!lambda/**/*.d.ts
node_modules

# CDK asset staging directory
.cdk.staging
cdk.out

.playwright-mcp/*
.claude*
.claude/*